        </div>
        <h2 class="text-[44px] font-black leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.53px] text-white mb-6 max-w-[820px] mx-auto" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:4s6955">Whatever the charge, talk to us first.</h2>
        <p class="text-[18.08px] leading-[31px] text-[#C3CCDA] max-w-[680px] mx-auto mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:8dsr8q">Your consultation is confidential and available 24/7. Tell us what you're facing and we'll explain how Michigan law applies to it.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-12" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:r8vat6">
          <a href="/#contact" class="bg-[#732521] text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:bg-[#5a1c19] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:fhqnwy">Request a Confidential Consultation<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
          <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="border border-white/30 text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:border-[#C9A840] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:wktefp">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 mt-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:r8vat7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:r8vat8">
            <a href="/" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:wktefq">Home</a>
            <a href="/practice-areas" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:wktefr">Practice Areas</a>
            <a href="/courtroom-victories" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:wktefs">Results</a>
