            <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="text-[#C9A840] font-bold text-[16px] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/milan-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:wktefx">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
